# FT232H JTAG adapter on the Astria/Leonidas board (USB connector J1).
# 0403:6014 is the FTDI default ID for the FT232H. The board's 93LC56 EEPROM
# could change it: check `lsusb` with the board attached before installing.
SUBSYSTEM=="usb", ATTRS{idVendor}=="0403", ATTRS{idProduct}=="6014", MODE="0660", GROUP="plugdev", TAG+="uaccess"
